# Terraform
#
# State can contain resource attributes and must never be committed. Real
# tfvars can carry values that are not placeholders. The example file and the
# provider lock file are deliberately NOT ignored: the lock file pins provider
# versions and belongs in version control.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
infra/terraform.tfvars
infra/*.auto.tfvars
!infra/terraform.tfvars.example
!**/.terraform.lock.hcl
